&= \frac{1}{2}\left(c - a + \frac{a^2 + ac - 2bc}{a - c} +  \frac{bc^2 + abc - 2a^2c}{b(c - a)} \right)
&= \frac{1}{2b(c - a)}\left(b(c - a)^2 - b(a^2 + ac - 2bc) + (bc^2 + abc - 2a^2c) \right)
&= \frac{1}{2b(c - a)} \left(2bc^2 - 2abc + 2b^2c - 2a^2c \right)
&= \frac{bc(b + c) - ac(a + b)}{b(c - a)}
\end{align*}
Similarly we find that,
