\frac{a^3}{a^6 + 8} 
&= \frac{\tfrac{17a - 20}{4}}{\tfrac{85a - 100}{32}} 
= \frac{17a - 20}{4} \cdot \frac{32}{85a - 100} [6pt]
&= \frac{8(17a - 20)}{5(17a - 20)} 
= \boxed{\frac{8}{5}}.
